Autochthonous faecal viral transfer (FVT) impacts the murine microbiome after 
antibiotic perturbation.

Draper LA(1)(2), Ryan FJ(1)(2)(3), Dalmasso M(1)(2)(4), Casey PG(2), McCann 
A(1)(2), Velayudhan V(1)(2), Ross RP(1), Hill C(5)(6).

