PRJEB58265	Crocidura russula			Spain	110	WGS	pubmed	37650630.0	37650630.0	Mammals show distinct functional gut microbiome dynamics to identical series of environmental stressors.	Koziol A	Alberdi A	Mammalia	"1. mBio. 2023 Oct 31;14(5):e0160623. doi: 10.1128/mbio.01606-23. Epub 2023 Aug
