ating a method mismatch with typical WGS metagenomics expectations.	none					No genuine reporting errors detected. Paper discusses mammalian (human) gut microbiota; deposit correctly specifies Homo sapiens. Metadata gaps exist (no explicit body-site/isolation-source fields) but do not contradict the paper's scope.	1		False		True	True
