Boosting natural history research via metagenomic clean-up of crowdsourced 
feces.

Srivathsan A(1), Nagarajan N(2)(3), Meier R(1)(4).

Author information:
(1)Department of Biological Sciences, National University of Singapore, 
Singapore.
(2)Computational and Systems Biology, Genome Institute of Singapore, Singapore.
