Epub 2025 Dec 24.

Gut microbiota dysbiosis exacerbates acute pancreatitis via Escherichia 
coli-driven neutrophil heterogeneity and NETosis.

Zou Y(1), Li N(1), Li X(1)(2), Kuang M(1), Xu X(1), Guan L(1), Li X(1), Zheng 
P(1), Li L(1), Wan J(1), Lu N(1), Liu J(1), He C(1), Zhu Y(1).

Author information:
(1)Department of Gastroenterology, Jiangxi Provincial Key Laboratory of 
Digestive Diseases, Jiangxi Clinical Research Center for Gastroenterology, 
Digestive Disease Hospital, The First Affiliated Hospital, Jiangxi Medical 
