Gut Feelings Begin in Childhood: the Gut Metagenome Correlates with Early 
Environment, Caregiving, and Behavior.

Flannery JE(1), Stagaman K(2), Burns AR(3), Hickey RJ(4)(5), Roos LE(6), 
Giuliano RJ(6), Fisher PA(1), Sharpton TJ(7)(8).

Author information:
