(2)Department of Microbiology, Oregon State University, Corvallis, Oregon, USA.
(3)Department of Medicine Division of Infectious Diseases, Stanford University 
School of Medicine, Stanford, California, USA.
(4)Biology of the Built Environment Center, University of Oregon, Eugene, 
