PRJNA847006	Sus scrofa	9823.0		China:Guangxi	60	WGS	pubmed	37049457.0	37049457.0	Metagenomic Sequencing Identified Specific Bacteriophage Signature Discriminating between Healthy and Diarrheal Neonatal Piglets.	Wang Z	Tao S	Mammalia	"1. Nutrients. 2023 Mar 27;15(7):1616. doi: 10.3390/nu15071616.

Metagenomic Sequencing Identified Specific Bacteriophage Signature 
Discriminating between Healthy and Diarrheal Neonatal Piglets.

Wang Z(1)(2), Li J(1), Ma L(3), Liu X(1), Wei H(1), Xiao Y(3), Tao S(1).

Author information:
(1)College of Animal Sciences and Technology, Huazhong Agricultural University, 
Wuhan 430070, China.
(2)State Key Laboratory of Animal Nutrition, College of Animal Science and 
Technology, China Agricultural University, No. 2 Yuanmingyuan West Road, Beijing 
100193, China.
(3)State Key Laboratory for Managing Biotic and Chemical Threats to the Quality 
and Safety of Agro-Products, Institute of Agro-Product Safety and Nutrition, 
