PRJNA384716	Homo sapiens	9606.0		Finland: Turku	96	WGS	pubmed	38882494.0	38882494.0	Infant age inversely correlates with gut carriage of resistance genes, reflecting modifications in microbial carbohydrate metabolism during early life.	Xu X	Liu J	Mammalia	"1. Imeta. 2024 Jan 31;3(2):e169. doi: 10.1002/imt2.169. eCollection 2024 Apr.

Infant age inversely correlates with gut carriage of resistance genes, 
reflecting modifications in microbial carbohydrate metabolism during early life.

Xu X(1)(2)(3), Feng Q(1)(2)(4), Zhang T(1)(2), Gao Y(1)(2), Cheng Q(5), Zhang 
W(1)(2), Wu Q(6), Xu K(7), Li Y(8), Nguyen N(9), Taft DH(9), Mills DA(9)(10), 
Lemay DG(11), Zhu W(1)(2), Mao S(1)(2), Zhang A(12), Xu K(13), Liu J(1)(2).

