Aging-Associated Augmentation of Gut Microbiome Virulence Capability Drives 
Sepsis Severity.

Colbert JF(1)(2)(3), Kirsch JM(2), Erzen CL(1), Langouët-Astrié CJ(1), Thompson 
GE(4), McMurtry SA(1), Kofonow JM(1), Robertson CE(1), Kovacs EJ(5), Sullivan 
