PRJNA718322	Mus musculus	10090.0			30	WGS	pubmed	35982311.0	35982311.0	Characterization of interactions of dietary cholesterol with the murine and human gut microbiome.	Le HH	Johnson EL	Mammalia	"1. Nat Microbiol. 2022 Sep;7(9):1390-1403. doi: 10.1038/s41564-022-01195-9. Epub 
