Comprehensive profile of the companion animal gut microbiome integrating 
reference-based and reference-free methods.

Branck T(1)(2)(3), Hu Z(1)(2), Nickols WA(1)(2)(4), Walsh AM(1)(2)(4), Bhosle 
A(1)(2)(4), Short MI(1)(2)(4), Nearing JT(1)(2)(4), Asnicar F(5), McIver 
