PRJNA1119029	Homo sapiens	9606.0		USA: Stanford	171	WGS	pubmed	40059174.0	40059174.0	Comprehensive profiling of genomic invertons in defined gut microbial community reveals associations with intestinal colonization and surface adhesion.	Jin X	Pollard KS	Mammalia	"1. Microbiome. 2025 Mar 10;13(1):71. doi: 10.1186/s40168-025-02052-7.

Comprehensive profiling of genomic invertons in defined gut microbial community 
reveals associations with intestinal colonization and surface adhesion.

Jin X(1)(2), Cheng AG(3)(4), Chanin RB(5), Yu FB(6), Dimas A(7), Jasper M(7), 
Weakley A(7), Yan J(7)(8), Bhatt AS(5)(9), Pollard KS(10)(11)(12).

