(2)Department of Biomedical Engineering, University of Calgary, Calgary, Canada.
(3)Department of Gastroenterology, Stanford School of Medicine, Stanford, USA.
(4)Section of Gastroenterology, University of Chicago, Chicago, USA.
(5)Division of Hematology, Stanford School of Medicine, Stanford, USA.
