Structure and Function of the Fecal Microbiota in Diarrheic Neonatal Piglets.

Yang Q(1), Huang X(1), Zhao S(1), Sun W(1), Yan Z(1), Wang P(1), Li S(1), Huang 
W(1), Zhang S(1), Liu L(2), Gun S(3).

Author information:
(1)College of Animal Science and Technology, Gansu Agricultural University 
Lanzhou, China.
(2)College of Life Science and Engineering, Northwest University for 
