Similarity of the dog and human gut microbiomes in gene content and response to 
diet.

Coelho LP(1), Kultima JR(1), Costea PI(1), Fournier C(2), Pan Y(3), 
Czarnecki-Maulden G(3), Hayward MR(1), Forslund SK(1), Schmidt TSB(1), Descombes 
