PRJNA1307965	Mus musculus	10090.0			14	WGS	pubmed	41291200.0	41291200.0	Triptolide ameliorates LPS-induced acute lung injury in Balb/c mice through gut-lung axis-mediated regulation of bile acid metabolism and gut microbiota.	Zha Y	Ren H	Mammalia	"1. Sci Rep. 2025 Nov 25;15(1):45351. doi: 10.1038/s41598-025-29758-w.

Triptolide ameliorates LPS-induced acute lung injury in Balb/c mice through 
gut-lung axis-mediated regulation of bile acid metabolism and gut microbiota.

Zha Y(1), Fan L(2), Shen T(3)(4), Zhang Y(1), Ren H(5).

Author information:
(1)School of Gongli Hospital Medical Technology, University of Shanghai for 
Science and Technology, Shanghai, 200093, China.
(2)Department of Prevention & Healthcare, Gongli Hospital of Shanghai Pudong New 
