Multi-omics reveals gut microbiota-mediated environmental adaptation in Mallards 
and domesticated Shaoxing ducks.

Zhang C(1), Wang X(2), Wang L(2), Li P(2), Bao Y(2), Zhang Z(2), Jiang Z(2), 
Feng C(3), Chen L(4).

