Alterations in Gut Microbiota Correlate With Hematological Injuries Induced by 
Radiation in Beagles.

Huang Z(1)(2), Wang L(1), Tong J(1), Zhao Y(1), Ling H(1)(3), Zhou Y(1), Tan 
