PRJNA301903	Homo sapiens	9606.0		USA: Saint Louis, MO	407	WGS	pubmed	38882494.0	38882494.0	Infant age inversely correlates with gut carriage of resistance genes, reflecting modifications in microbial carbohydrate metabolism during early life.	Xu X	Liu J	Mammalia	"1. Imeta. 2024 Jan 31;3(2):e169. doi: 10.1002/imt2.169. eCollection 2024 Apr.

Infant age inversely correlates with gut carriage of resistance genes, 
reflecting modifications in microbial carbohydrate metabolism during early life.

