PRJNA1210771	Euphausia superba	6819.0		Antarctica	22	WGS	pubmed_metagenom_b1	40772734.0		Metabolic potentials of the gut microbes in Antarctic krill (Euphausia superba).			Malacostraca	"1. mSystems. 2025 Sep 23;10(9):e0037725. doi: 10.1128/msystems.00377-25. Epub
