Metabolic potentials of the gut microbes in Antarctic krill (Euphausia superba).

Wei Z(1), Meng L(2), Du S(1), Wang F(3), Jiang A(4), Lu R(5), Liu K(1), Wang 
X(3), Xu Q(3), Mu X(3), Meng L(5), Shao C(1).

