E. coli genetically modified for purine nucleobase release promotes butyrate 
generation and colonic wound healing during DSS insult.

Lee JS(1), Kao DJ(1), Worledge CS(1), Villamaria ZF(1), Wang RX(1), Welch 
NM(1)(2), Kostelecky RE(1), Colgan SP(1)(2).

