flavonoids of Rhizoma Drynariae on reducing ovariectomized-induced osteoporosis 
by regulating gut microbiota and related metabolites.

Li Q(1), Wu X(1), Niu X(1), Yu Z(1), Fang S(2), Chu X(2), Zhu J(1), Song Q(1), 
Hou C(2), Wei X(3).

Author information:
(1)Pharmacological Laboratory of Traditional Chinese Medicine, Wangjing 
