PRJNA1180206	Mus musculus	10090.0		China: Jiangsu	30	WGS	pubmed_metagenom_b1	39628383.0		Gut microbiota metabolism of branched-chain amino acids and their metabolites can improve the physiological function of aging mice.			Mammalia	"1. Aging Cell. 2025 Apr;24(4):e14434. doi: 10.1111/acel.14434. Epub 2024 Dec 4.

Gut microbiota metabolism of branched-chain amino acids and their metabolites 
can improve the physiological function of aging mice.

Wang H(1)(2), Feng L(1)(2), Pei Z(1)(2), Zhao J(1)(2), Lu S(3), Lu W(1)(2)(4).

Author information:
(1)State Key Laboratory of Food Science and Technology, Jiangnan University, 
