Unveiling lignocellulolytic potential: a genomic exploration of bacterial 
lineages within the termite gut.

Salgado JFM(1), Hervé V(1), Vera MAG(1), Tokuda G(2), Brune A(3).

Author information:
(1)RG Insect Microbiology and Symbiosis, Max Planck Institute for Terrestrial 
Microbiology, 35043, Marburg, Germany.
(2)Tropical Biosphere Research Center, Center of Molecular Biosciences, 
