PRJNA1302101	Phalacrocorax auritus	56069.0		USA: Mississippi	2	Hi-C	pubmed_metagenom_b1	42354826.0		Hi-C Metagenome Deconvolution of Double-Crested Cormorant (Nannopterum auritum) Fecal Samples Demonstrates Feasibility of Linking Microbial Genomes, AMR Genes, and Mobile Elements in Avian Microbiomes.			Aves	"1. Microorganisms. 2026 May 26;14(6):1198. doi: 10.3390/microorganisms14061198.

Hi-C Metagenome Deconvolution of Double-Crested Cormorant (Nannopterum auritum) 
Fecal Samples Demonstrates Feasibility of Linking Microbial Genomes, AMR Genes, 
and Mobile Elements in Avian Microbiomes.

O'Donald SN(1), Patel F(1), Keen P(2), Hanson LA(1), Cunningham F(3), Lawrence 
ML(1)(4), Tekedar HC(1).

Author information:
(1)Department of Comparative Biomedical Sciences, College of Veterinary 
