Characterization of DNA Viruses in Hindgut Contents of Protaetia brevitarsis 
Larvae.

Min JG(1), Min N(2), Nguyen BT(3)(4), Flores RA(5), Yim D(3).

Author information:
(1)Department of Applied Biology, Kyungpook National University, Daegu 41566, 
