Shared environments complicate the use of strain-resolved metagenomics to infer 
microbiome transmission.

Debray R(1), Dickson CC(2), Webb SE(2), Archie EA(2), Tung J(1)(3)(4)(5)(6).

Author information:
(1)Department of Primate Behavior and Evolution, Max Planck Institute for 
