Magnolia Officinalis Alcohol Extract Alleviates the Intestinal Injury Induced by 
Polygala Tenuifolia Through Regulating the PI3K/AKT/NF-κB Signaling Pathway and 
Intestinal Flora.

Liu S(1), Yang D(1), Li W(1), Chen Q(1), Lu D(1), Xiong L(1), Wu J(1), Ao H(1), 
Huang L(1).

Author information:
(1)State Key Laboratory of Southwestern Chinese Medicine Resources, School of 
