Enterococcus casseliflavus regulates amino acid metabolism in edible insect 
Clanis bilineata tsingtauica: a functional metagenomics study.

Qian L(1), Wang Y(2), Deng P(1), Zhang J(3), Qin Y(1), Li Z(1), Liao H(1)(4), 
Chen F(2).

Author information:
(1)Institute of Leisure Agriculture, Jiangsu Academy of Agricultural Sciences, 
Nanjing, China.
(2)College of Plant Protection, Nanjing Agricultural University, Nanjing, China.
(3)College of Plant Protection, Yangzhou University, Yangzhou, China.
(4)College of Biotechnology, Jiangsu University of Science and Technology, 
