With the advent of metagenomics has come an increased appreciation for the gut 
microbiome's role in overall health of mammalian organisms. Even so, studies 
characterizing taxonomic and functional diversity of the ferret gut microbiome 
remain limited. Here, we present 25 metagenome-assembled genomes recovered from 
the gut microbiome of domestic ferrets.

