Host diet shapes functionally differentiated gut microbiomes in sympatric 
speciation of blind mole rats in Upper Galilee, Israel.

Kuang Z(1), Li F(2), Duan Q(1), Tian C(3), Nevo E(4), Li K(1).

Author information:
(1)State Key Laboratory of Grassland Agro-ecosystems, College of Ecology, 
Lanzhou University, Lanzhou, China.
(2)Department of Zoology, College of Life Sciences and Technology, Mudanjiang 
