Xiong Fu Powder Regulates the Intestinal Microenvironment to Protect Bones 
Against Destruction in Collagen-Induced Arthritis Rat Models.

Xi X(1), Ye Q(1), Li X(2), Lu X(1)(3), Fan D(4)(5), Xia Y(1), Xiao C(4)(6).

