Integrated Metagenomics and Metabolomics to Reveal the Effects of Policosanol on 
Modulating the Gut Microbiota and Lipid Metabolism in Hyperlipidemic C57BL/6 
Mice.

Zhai Z(1)(2), Liu J(1), Niu KM(1)(2), Lin C(1), Tu Y(1), Liu Y(1), Cai L(1), Liu 
H(3), Ouyang K(1).

Author information:
