A Metagenomic Insight Into the Hindgut Microbiota and Their Metabolites for 
Dairy Goats Fed Different Rumen Degradable Starch.

Han X(1), Lei X(1), Yang X(1), Shen J(1), Zheng L(1), Jin C(1), Cao Y(1), Yao 
