Discovering multiple types of DNA methylation from bacteria and microbiome using 
nanopore sequencing.

Tourancheau A(1), Mead EA(1), Zhang XS(2), Fang G(3).

Author information:
(1)Department of Genetics and Genomic Sciences and Icahn Institute for Genomics 
and Multiscale Biology, Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai, New York, NY, 
