Metagenomic insights into the diversity of carbohydrate-degrading enzymes in the 
yak fecal microbial community.

Gong G(1), Zhou S(1), Luo R(1), Gesang Z(2), Suolang S(3).

Author information:
(1)Department of Animal Science, Tibet Agricultural and Animal Husbandry 
College, Linzhi, Tibet, China.
